        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Let's go!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "1": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's ridiculous to think you can win against me!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "2": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So frustrating."
            ]
        }
    },
    "3": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hey, Reimu!"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The village is in turmoil!"
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You don't say!"
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Animal spirits are seriously going on the offensive.",
                "I expected that, but..."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It must be the work of the",
                "beast realm's outlaws!"
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Animal spirits?",
                "Offensive?"
            ]
        },
        "82_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Have you not been thinking straight?",
                "That's not the important part."
            ]
        },
        "90_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What's important is the land ownership!"
            ]
        },
        "98_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Land ownership which some rich",
                "spirits have never given up,"
            ]
        },
        "106_0": {
            "lines": [
                "was suddenly relinquished.",
                "The situation is not dire, but fortunate!"
            ]
        },
        "114_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I gotta grab whatever I can before",
                "any greedy spirits show up and take over!"
            ]
        },
        "122_0": {
            "lines": [
                "...I see."
            ]
        },
        "138_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Marisa, stop being crazy!"
            ]
        },
        "130_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're on the other side."
            ]
        },
        "146_0": {
            "lines": [
                "If you wish to give up your human intelligence",
                "and let primal desires control you,"
            ]
        },
        "154_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'll see you as nothing more than a beast!",
                "Stay down!"
            ]
        },
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "There's no doubt about it."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Because of that market god, ",
                "the surface is undergoing a revolution."
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "There's no way I'll pass up this chance!"
            ]
        },
        "124_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh, if it isn't Marisa."
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I didn't expect to see you here."
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "A moon rabbit...",
                "Did you really not expect to run into me here?"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh well, you don't seem unrelated to this incident, anyway."
            ]
        }
    },
    "4": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It seems like the Moon's forces are",
                "trying to get their hands on the land..."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I better hurry."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Don't you have the same idea?"
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Yes, it's weak but I can feel a new kind of magic",
                "influencing this land scramble."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "This isn't something beasts can manage."
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "To prepare for the inevitable incident,",
                "we should start getting the land under our control."
            ]
        }
    },
    "5": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Laters!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "6": {
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What else would I do when spirits are making a ruckus?"
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I can't just sit around and do nothing!"
            ]
        },
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Aren't you that Aun-chan from the shrine?",
                "I knew you'd get involved!"
            ]
        },
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The village is full of phantoms too."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Have others got eyes on this too...?"
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That's a bummer, but maybe I should ",
                "|\ttalk to \t,\tReimu\t,her",
                "talk to Reimu about it."
            ]
        },
        "124_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Whoops."
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What terrible timing to run into a terrible person."
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "If it isn't the mouse from Myouren Temple!"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Aren't you observant?",
                "I can't believe you've got eyes on the incident too."
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What?",
                "Is that a bad thing?"
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I discovered that treasure first, so it's mine!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "8": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "This area was a bust anyways.",
                "I'll go look for another place."
            ]
        }
    },
    "7": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well, I'm not so rusty that I'd lose to a mouse."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Although I'm not sure if koaminu",
                "count as beasts or not..."
            ]
        }
    },
    "9": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "If it isn't the mouse from Myouren Temple!"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Your eyes are sharp.",
                "Sharp enough to zero in on this incident."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Okay?",
                "Is that a problem?"
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm the first one who found it.",
                "This whole area is mine to search!"
            ]
        },
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Wow...",
                "The incident reaches this deep into the mountains."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I don't think ordinary people understand, but,",
                "as a magician, I do."
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's as if the world has turned back into nothingness."
            ]
        },
        "28_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Maybe that market god was truly something else."
            ]
        },
        "132_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ah, Marisa."
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're hiking without a care in a place like this?"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What? Reimu,",
                "This is no time for jokes!"
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "This whole place is in turmoil!"
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm not blind, you know!"
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I expected an all-out attack from the beast spirits, but..."
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It must be the work of those ",
                "outlaws from the Animal Realm!"
            ]
        },
        "208_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Beast spirits?",
                "Attacking?"
            ]
        },
        "216_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Are you half asleep?",
                "That sure isn't what's important!"
            ]
        },
        "224_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Land ownership is the actual problem here!"
            ]
        },
        "232_0": {
            "lines": [
                "There was land some rich spirits weren't",
                "ever going to give up."
            ]
        },
        "240_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Suddenly, they abandoned it.",
                "This is an opportunity, not a crisis!"
            ]
        },
        "248_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Let's take whatever we can before",
                "any greedy spirits take over!"
            ]
        },
        "256_0": {
            "lines": [
                "...I see."
            ]
        },
        "264_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're on <i$their> side, aren't you?"
            ]
        },
        "272_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Open your eyes, Marisa!"
            ]
        },
        "280_0": {
            "lines": [
                "If you've given up your human intellect and",
                "surrendered yourself to the law of the jungle…"
            ]
        },
        "288_0": {
            "lines": [
                "...you're already a beast.",
                "I'll exorcise you!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "10": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Nice! I won!"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Anyways, beast spirits?",
                "You think the mastermind's from the Animal Realm, Reimu?"
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Don't <i$you>?"
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "No, I don't. I'm feeling a faint, unknown magic",
                "influencing this scramble for the land."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That's not something beasts are capable of."
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "We should grab that land as a",
                "precaution for the coming incident."
            ]
        }
    },
    "11": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You won, you won!",
                "I surrender!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "12": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh, Marisa!"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Didn't expect to run into you here."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Moon rabbit...",
                "You really didn't expect to meet me?"
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's okay, seems you've got",
                "something to do with this mess anyway."
            ]
        },
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So the way Reimu sees it, this incident",
                "looks like another attempt of Animal Realm invasion."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Now that I say it, the beast spirits'",
                "movements are also a little bit suspicious."
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But other spirits are making a ruckus too.",
                "Maybe I'm overthinking it..."
            ]
        },
        "124_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh, isn't that Marisa?"
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Long time no see.",
                "I hope you've been well and strong."
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Gh! You're...",
                "...from the Animal Realm!"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You can always become a part of the Keiga Family, ",
                "you just need to say the word."
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "With that might of yours, ",
                "you can start at a high rank right away."
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Wha- ugh, that's not what I'm here for."
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So Reimu <i$did> have a point? Was she right about ",
                "the Animal Realm trying to take over the Human Realm...?"
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hah-hah-hah, nevermind that."
            ]
        },
        "208_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Everyone on the surface will soon",
                "be the Keiga Family's subordinates nonetheless."
            ]
        },
        "216_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's the beginning of a new era on the",
                "surface, where might makes right!"
            ]
        },
        "224_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Seriously!?",
                "<b$Seriously!?>"
            ]
        },
        "232_0": {
            "lines": [
                "This has to be stopped!",
                "Right here! Right now!"
            ]
        },
        "240_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So, come on!",
                "The weak will be kicked off the surface!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "14": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Weak!",
                "You're so boring like this!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "13": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Don't even think about trying to take over the surface."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Kehehe...",
                "You're way too late."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "A new ally of the Keiga Family has already been born on the surface."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What?"
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Taking over the surface with bodies that aren't ",
                "flesh and bone has proven to be inconvenient."
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I've found the most powerful beast in the Forest of Magic."
            ]
        },
        "82_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The Keiga Family has become invincible!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "15": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The Keiga Family's new ally?"
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "She said they were in the Forest of Magic..."
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "They belong to the Keiga Family right?",
                "I wonder what sort of meathead they found."
            ]
        },
        "28_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Taking over the surface will be difficult for them ",
                "if all they have are people who boast about their strength..."
            ]
        },
        "36_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Maybe I could put them to good use..."
            ]
        },
        "140_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Target acquired!"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Just like Lady Saki said."
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "\"The most important person will",
                "return to the Forest of Magic.\""
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Wh... who are you?",
                "Are you that Keiga famil-"
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I am a commander of the Keiga Family's surface team.",
                "Name's Enoko!"
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "By Lady Saki's order, I'll capture you",
                "and enlist you to fight for the Keiga Family!"
            ]
        },
        "208_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Here. Here she is!",
                "The meathead!"
            ]
        },
        "216_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And so, let the fight begin!",
                "I'll grind you to death with my fangs!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "16": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh wow, you've become strong!"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You don't seem like that little girl",
                "who ran off crying into the woods anymore."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Huh?",
                "Who are you?"
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But back then I too was just an old yamainu."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "...I've been sensing some strong magic."
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's coming from that pendant on your neck."
            ]
        },
        "82_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What <i$is> it?"
            ]
        },
        "90_0": {
            "lines": [
                "This?",
                "Lady Saki gave this pendant to me."
            ]
        },
        "98_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I don't know what it really is, either."
            ]
        },
        "106_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It doesn't belong here.",
                "This is magic that returns everything back to nothingness..."
            ]
        },
        "114_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Damn it, I think this magic item got a hold of me...",
                "...I'm getting sleepy..."
            ]
        }
    },
    "17": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "...what?",
                "You're not even close to disappointing me."
            ]
        }
    },
    "18": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "... Where am I?"
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Where am I?",
                "What on earth happened...?"
            ]
        },
        "116_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're awake."
            ]
        },
        "144_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The further you meddle with this incident, ",
                "the worse it will get."
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That's why I put you to sleep."
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Wh... huh?",
                "You put me to sleep?"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What the hell are you..."
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "My name is Zanmu Nippaku."
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The one who shall quell the chaos that besets the surface."
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Your selfish actions have been deemed",
                "a hindrance in my eyes."
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What are you talking about?"
            ]
        },
        "208_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I took down the beasts that plotted the surface invasion!"
            ]
        },
        "216_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're also a member of the Keiga Family, aren't you?"
            ]
        },
        "224_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm not leaving this to Reimu.",
                "I'll do away with your little scheme!"
            ]
        },
        "232_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hehe..."
            ]
        },
        "240_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You dare mention me under the same breath as those beasts?",
                "You have no common sense."
            ]
        },
        "248_0": {
            "lines": [
                "As expected of someone who was charmed ",
                "by that tiny little jewel."
            ]
        },
        "256_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well, that was just one of my traps."
            ]
        },
        "264_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Wha-"
            ]
        },
        "272_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Don't make our battle turn out the way I planned."
            ]
        },
        "280_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Overcome that fantasy with all you've got!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "20": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The world keeps revolving as planned."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What a shame..."
            ]
        }
    }
